Paper example 076: Clamping to an argument-dependent interval

#paper: 76
#mode: evaluation
#inlinetest:exclude Not an executable S_H/A example; see TestQuantifiedPaperIndex.
#skip
Dependent profile D (out of scope).

-- paper.cue.txt --
clamp: func(lo: int, hi: int & >=lo, x: int) -> (
    int & >=lo & <=hi
): {
    if x < lo {out: lo}
    if x > hi {out: hi}
    if x >= lo && x <= hi {out: x}
}.out

bounded: clamp(0, 10, 14) // 10
